- op: discuss  # e608
  at: '2026-09-03T08:57:12Z'  # e608
  by: agent  # e608
  actor: jgstern_agent  # e608
  clock: 3  # e608
  nonce: e608  # e608
  message: "ADR-0051 annotation (WI-virav; annotate only -- no fold, no closure, no re-prioritisation). CLAUSES VIOLATED: \"names the static owner path ... spelled in the source language's import vocabulary\" AND \"not a marker for the absence of an answer\". NOTION THE SLOT CARRIES: sentinel (`external`) while the real owner path (`std::env`, `fs`, `Stdio`) is displaced into the NAME slot -- the audit's Pair 3 (qualifier in the NAME slot), rust's spelling of the defect INV-januj was filed for in python and INV-fofoj's java half turned out to be. The conformant form is emitted by a sibling path in the same run, so this is two producers disagreeing about which slot owns the path."  # e608
